kl 1
physics gates@1
fabric 16x8 layers=ground
region build all
carrier wire ground
lib MIX 3x3 { a in wire W0 ; b in wire W2 ; y out wire E1 }
lib PASS 2x3 { a in wire W1 ; y out wire E1 }
lib SINK 1x1 { a in wire W0 }
lib SRC 1x1 { y out wire E0 }
cell mix MIX
cell out SINK
cell src SRC
cell stage PASS
net back wire 4 : stage.y -> mix.b out.a
net feed wire 10 : src.y -> mix.a
net made wire 8 : mix.y -> stage.a
